WEBVTT

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:19.895
Huh?

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.856
What is this place?

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:34.535
The output is unstable.
The erg value is nearing critical.

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:36.453
-What the...
-Prepare for valve release!

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:38.914
Excess current from the reactor
still increasing.

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:42.000
Cut power assist!
Release a fourth of the valve!

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:16.928
The Cries of Chaos

00:02:25.228 --> 00:02:26.480
You're tired already?

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.982
You're too much, Queenie!

00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:34.488
I'm really glad the Princess accepted
the refugees.

00:02:34.863 --> 00:02:37.616
But we do have
an energy and resource shortage.

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:39.242
I'm worried about the future.

00:02:39.701 --> 00:02:42.245
It'll be okay. We have a great team.

00:02:42.663 --> 00:02:43.664
Besides,

00:02:44.164 --> 00:02:48.251
Leon seems to be hard at work making
some epidemic countermeasure system.

00:02:48.335 --> 00:02:51.088
You mean the guy who gave up
on the third day of training?

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.090
I'm sure he's still asleep.

00:02:53.465 --> 00:02:57.094
No, he headed off somewhere
early this morning.

00:02:57.969 --> 00:02:59.054
That's unusual.

00:03:00.138 --> 00:03:02.057
Suppress the reactor's output?

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:03.725
Now of all times?

00:03:03.975 --> 00:03:05.977
<i>Something has been off the past few days.</i>

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:09.439
<i>Worst-case scenario,</i>
<i>it could go berserk again.</i>

00:03:10.357 --> 00:03:14.319
But the accumulation rates
were within the normal range this morning.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:18.198
That's right. Even I almost missed it.

00:03:20.742 --> 00:03:21.910
Look at this.

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:26.164
There is a phenomenon called
quantum tunneling,

00:03:26.498 --> 00:03:29.960
in which a particle passes through
an energy barrier it normally could not.

00:03:30.377 --> 00:03:32.003
During the reactor's development,

00:03:32.087 --> 00:03:35.716
a high precision blockade system
was incorporated, but...

00:03:36.967 --> 00:03:38.468
Take a look at this data.

00:03:39.511 --> 00:03:40.512
What am I looking at?

00:03:40.637 --> 00:03:44.975
Due to this tunneling, quantum energy
may be leaking from the reactor.

00:03:45.976 --> 00:03:51.565
We tried repairing it remotely with both
software and hardware, but to no avail.

00:03:51.648 --> 00:03:52.524
What?

00:03:52.691 --> 00:03:56.528
So, any potential problems
would be in the heart of the reactor.

00:03:56.737 --> 00:03:57.612
In other words...

00:03:58.405 --> 00:03:59.239
The core.

00:03:59.406 --> 00:04:00.407
Right.

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:04.161
However, contact with the core
comes with a number of risks.

00:04:04.661 --> 00:04:06.580
It's as if it's a forbidden box...

00:04:07.748 --> 00:04:09.708
Will we find hope inside?

00:04:10.333 --> 00:04:12.043
Or a deceased cat?

00:04:15.422 --> 00:04:16.256
Jay.

00:04:16.423 --> 00:04:19.509
Calculate how much power the reactor
can produce while suppressed.

00:04:19.676 --> 00:04:20.719
Princess!

00:04:21.011 --> 00:04:25.599
<i>We are experiencing a shortage of power</i>
<i>due to the influx of refugees.</i>

00:04:26.641 --> 00:04:28.643
Suppressing the reactor's output now
would...

00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:31.104
Would you rather the Earth be destroyed?

00:04:32.647 --> 00:04:34.399
Leon, we need to talk.

00:04:34.524 --> 00:04:35.692
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:37.778 --> 00:04:38.820
Jay.

00:04:39.154 --> 00:04:42.365
Carry out the calculations
by the time I get back.

00:04:52.209 --> 00:04:54.252
Wait. Could this BRAI be...

00:04:54.753 --> 00:04:56.463
So, it was alive this whole time.

00:04:56.671 --> 00:04:58.089
It's just a rumor, isn't it?

00:04:58.215 --> 00:04:59.633
There's no doubt it's true!

00:05:00.175 --> 00:05:04.179
Is it the giant BRAI that Neo Xianglong
failed to capture two years ago?

00:05:04.596 --> 00:05:05.597
<i>Yes.</i>

00:05:06.223 --> 00:05:09.893
<i>We used all the energy in Neo Xianglong</i>
<i>to bombard it, but...</i>

00:05:10.727 --> 00:05:12.145
we couldn't beat it.

00:05:14.189 --> 00:05:15.774
It was in that battle, my friend...

00:05:16.066 --> 00:05:17.400
My superior officer...

00:05:17.609 --> 00:05:21.112
I see.
So, that's how the boy became the Sarge?

00:05:21.446 --> 00:05:23.698
I'm neither of those! It's Captain!

00:05:25.075 --> 00:05:26.785
So, this is where you all were.

00:05:27.369 --> 00:05:29.621
Having a late lunch, little sis?

00:05:29.746 --> 00:05:31.498
My name is Chloe!

00:05:32.207 --> 00:05:34.417
Are you looking at erotic photos again?

00:05:35.418 --> 00:05:37.879
It's an acquired adult taste.

00:05:38.505 --> 00:05:42.050
Don't teach Leon such sleazy things.

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:46.638
I'm sure even an upstanding scientist
spends nights with women, too.

00:05:47.722 --> 00:05:49.266
You're the worst.

00:05:51.309 --> 00:05:52.644
Emilia, you're on her side?

00:05:52.852 --> 00:05:54.187
Get him, you ugly cat!

00:05:54.271 --> 00:05:56.481
She's not ugly, she's beautiful!

00:06:01.069 --> 00:06:02.028
It's mine now!

00:06:02.112 --> 00:06:02.988
Give it back!

00:06:03.196 --> 00:06:05.031
You'll have to take it from me!

00:06:06.866 --> 00:06:08.076
Wait up!

00:06:15.834 --> 00:06:16.668
Is that...

00:06:17.836 --> 00:06:19.212
That is my birthplace.

00:06:21.172 --> 00:06:22.465
Since ancient times,

00:06:22.799 --> 00:06:25.051
my family has protected Xianglong's soil,

00:06:25.552 --> 00:06:27.637
and occasionally endured its wrath.

00:06:28.305 --> 00:06:31.266
Are you referring to feng shui
and divination?

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:33.393
Do you find it unscientific?

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:35.520
Not as a whole, but...

00:06:36.104 --> 00:06:38.148
Then see it with your own eyes.

00:06:39.691 --> 00:06:43.236
Once you pass this point,
there is no going back.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.780
Do you still wish to know?

00:06:49.034 --> 00:06:50.201
You're sure, then.

00:06:50.994 --> 00:06:55.415
If it's going to destroy this mad world
and create a new one.

00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:57.917
Then let's proceed.

00:07:12.599 --> 00:07:13.892
A quantum barrier?

00:07:14.726 --> 00:07:18.396
In the past, "Chaos" resided here.

00:07:19.314 --> 00:07:20.398
Chaos...

00:07:21.691 --> 00:07:23.193
<i>My name is Chaos.</i>

00:07:25.946 --> 00:07:26.988
Since ancient times,

00:07:27.238 --> 00:07:30.784
it's been said that Chaos
has the power to change the world.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:33.662
Countless wars have been waged

00:07:34.162 --> 00:07:36.998
all for the purpose of
claiming this power.

00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:41.962
Gold is a descendant of those
who sought this power.

00:07:42.671 --> 00:07:47.884
However, nobody was able
to harness its true power.

00:07:48.551 --> 00:07:50.220
Not until he appeared.

00:07:51.262 --> 00:07:52.263
Lon.

00:07:55.517 --> 00:07:59.437
<i>Our family made the decision</i>
<i>to entrust Chaos to him,</i>

00:07:59.938 --> 00:08:03.900
<i>after he declared he wanted to use Chaos</i>
<i>for the sake of mankind.</i>

00:08:04.859 --> 00:08:06.319
<i>But there were conditions.</i>

00:08:06.778 --> 00:08:09.239
<i>His research facilities would be</i>
<i>based in Xianglong,</i>

00:08:10.156 --> 00:08:12.575
<i>and he would be under my supervision.</i>

00:08:14.244 --> 00:08:16.413
The result is the world we now inhabit.

00:08:17.747 --> 00:08:19.749
I failed as a guardian.

00:08:20.625 --> 00:08:23.628
So this "Chaos" is the reactor core...

00:08:25.714 --> 00:08:27.173
What is it, exactly?

00:08:28.049 --> 00:08:30.427
Along with the relics of gods,

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:34.014
it is said to be the power
that created the world.

00:08:34.347 --> 00:08:36.141
The power that created the world?

00:08:36.433 --> 00:08:39.019
So, it's the nucleus
connecting the parallel worlds.

00:08:44.274 --> 00:08:46.484
Not even Jay knows about Chaos.

00:08:47.819 --> 00:08:51.489
You are the second person
outside of our family

00:08:51.656 --> 00:08:52.907
to visit this shrine.

00:08:53.158 --> 00:08:54.159
Huh?

00:09:00.331 --> 00:09:02.417
You may be able to see it.

00:09:12.677 --> 00:09:13.887
-Hey!
-Ouch.

00:09:14.763 --> 00:09:18.349
Sexual harassment is unbecoming
of a man of your rank.

00:09:18.516 --> 00:09:19.976
Oh, it's you.

00:09:20.685 --> 00:09:24.898
She seemed a little worn out,
so I was giving her a massage.

00:09:25.065 --> 00:09:27.901
The reactor has been acting strangely
the past few days.

00:09:28.068 --> 00:09:32.363
I want to discuss suppressing its output,
as well as our goals for its future.

00:09:32.572 --> 00:09:35.408
Come on,
you're talking about work already?

00:09:35.742 --> 00:09:39.662
Couldn't you bring me some flowers
or sweets, considering?

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.539
Did you want flowers?

00:09:43.041 --> 00:09:45.001
I can't eat that.

00:09:46.669 --> 00:09:51.841
The refugees, the Red Death,
the giant BRAI, and now the reactor.

00:09:52.217 --> 00:09:53.885
What perfect timing.

00:09:54.594 --> 00:09:56.930
You think our enemy planned this?

00:10:00.183 --> 00:10:01.601
It must be tough for you, too.

00:10:04.354 --> 00:10:05.188
<i>I...</i>

00:10:05.605 --> 00:10:07.857
<i>was employed by the Princess</i>
<i>from a young age</i>

00:10:08.066 --> 00:10:11.111
<i>and, in order to protect this town,</i>
<i>learned many things.</i>

00:10:11.861 --> 00:10:15.740
But, now that the world has changed...

00:10:16.116 --> 00:10:18.243
You feel useless?

00:10:19.452 --> 00:10:24.791
Or maybe someone's taken your place
and now you're just jealous?

00:10:26.626 --> 00:10:27.961
Don't waste your breath.

00:10:38.096 --> 00:10:39.097
Leon Lau.

00:10:40.473 --> 00:10:42.350
Gaze into the depths of Chaos.

00:10:42.976 --> 00:10:44.519
Control the reactor,

00:10:45.061 --> 00:10:46.479
fight the BRAI,

00:10:47.147 --> 00:10:48.940
and protect Neo Xianglong.

00:10:49.858 --> 00:10:52.402
All that responsibility
is making me dizzy.

00:10:52.694 --> 00:10:55.155
I expect nothing less than perfection.

00:10:55.738 --> 00:10:56.990
You should know by now.

00:10:57.699 --> 00:10:59.159
I'm greedy.

00:11:00.743 --> 00:11:01.953
I'm well aware...

00:11:02.453 --> 00:11:03.788
Cecile.

00:11:18.219 --> 00:11:20.763
If you're going to pet her,
I suggest the stomach.

00:11:26.436 --> 00:11:31.441
See? Fluffy, fluffy. Fluffy, fluffy.

00:11:32.233 --> 00:11:34.736
That guy, Hao Won, was it?

00:11:35.111 --> 00:11:39.032
You haven't settled things yet, have you?
What do you plan to do now?

00:11:39.365 --> 00:11:43.161
I promised Chloe
that we would go to a shaved ice stand

00:11:43.328 --> 00:11:44.996
that we saw in the city together.

00:11:45.204 --> 00:11:46.998
You two are quite close.

00:11:48.541 --> 00:11:50.043
What are you going to do?

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:53.254
Well...

00:11:54.339 --> 00:11:57.467
Please. Even if I don't make it,

00:11:57.759 --> 00:11:59.218
take care of her.

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:04.641
Emilia went and
got attached to little sis, you see...

00:12:07.518 --> 00:12:10.563
In the end, you couldn't do anything.

00:12:11.481 --> 00:12:14.817
Ever since our ancestors were defeated
by that woman's family,

00:12:15.068 --> 00:12:18.905
<i>we've had this absurd master and servant</i>
<i>relationship forced on us.</i>

00:12:21.532 --> 00:12:23.326
<i>They look down on us.</i>

00:12:23.576 --> 00:12:25.745
Tradition? Master and servant?

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.497
It makes me sick!

00:12:30.208 --> 00:12:32.710
You must despise that woman.

00:12:33.044 --> 00:12:34.796
I'll avenge you.

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:39.092
To that end,
I'll need to make use of you as well,

00:12:39.884 --> 00:12:41.511
Father.

00:12:43.012 --> 00:12:44.764
<i>How indulgent.</i>

00:12:45.264 --> 00:12:48.393
<i>In this world where everyone</i>
<i>is only concerned about themselves,</i>

00:12:48.601 --> 00:12:51.437
<i>you're worried about not being useful</i>
<i>to others.</i>

00:12:52.188 --> 00:12:55.608
With a body like this,
there's a limit to what I can do.

00:12:56.526 --> 00:12:58.653
Even so, I can still manage to prepare

00:12:58.736 --> 00:13:01.698
a delicious meal for those who've
just finished their work.

00:13:02.782 --> 00:13:07.120
As long as you're doing
what you can, that's plenty.

00:13:08.913 --> 00:13:10.164
Sorry for the wait!

00:13:10.415 --> 00:13:11.541
Here you go.

00:13:11.666 --> 00:13:13.251
Many thanks, girlie.

00:13:14.002 --> 00:13:17.338
Commander, you're going to eat pepper
even in the hospital?

00:13:17.463 --> 00:13:20.299
The food here is so bland.

00:13:22.552 --> 00:13:24.303
Jay, you're here, too.

00:13:25.722 --> 00:13:26.723
Yes.

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:28.808
Is something wrong?

00:13:29.392 --> 00:13:30.309
No.

00:13:33.271 --> 00:13:36.482
<i>I want to be strong...</i>
<i>for this town and and for the Princess.</i>

00:13:37.066 --> 00:13:39.444
<i>That's what I've always wished for. But...</i>

00:13:40.236 --> 00:13:41.654
<i>I can't fight.</i>

00:13:41.988 --> 00:13:42.864
<i>I can't lead.</i>

00:13:43.573 --> 00:13:45.616
<i>I can't contribute anything.</i>

00:13:48.036 --> 00:13:49.871
<i>There's not a single thing I can...</i>

00:13:49.954 --> 00:13:51.664
XIAOLONG FIRST MEDICAL CENTER

00:13:54.917 --> 00:13:55.752
Hey!

00:13:56.044 --> 00:13:56.878
Leon!

00:13:57.670 --> 00:13:58.504
Be careful!

00:13:58.838 --> 00:14:00.214
Jay.

00:14:01.382 --> 00:14:02.925
Huh? Is this a hospital?

00:14:03.384 --> 00:14:04.385
Where's the reactor?

00:14:04.469 --> 00:14:05.553
You're lost again.

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:09.223
As usual, you have no intention
of learning the roads here?

00:14:09.432 --> 00:14:10.433
Well...

00:14:12.977 --> 00:14:14.687
I suppose I'm the one who's lost.

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:17.857
What are you doing? Come on.

00:14:17.982 --> 00:14:18.983
Okay.

00:14:24.822 --> 00:14:27.367
Farewell, Father.

00:14:42.757 --> 00:14:46.886
The reactor is reporting abnormal values.
BRAI-like electromagnetic waves detected.

00:14:47.178 --> 00:14:50.598
-Electronic devices are being affected.
-<i>Princess, Leon and I are</i>

00:14:50.681 --> 00:14:52.350
<i>heading to the reactor's main unit.</i>

00:14:52.433 --> 00:14:53.559
Understood.

00:14:54.227 --> 00:14:57.438
Sector three reports that the gas supply
has been interrupted.

00:14:57.563 --> 00:15:00.525
Power output from the reactor is unstable.

00:15:02.402 --> 00:15:04.153
We're going down the elevator?

00:15:04.445 --> 00:15:08.116
With all the electrical grid problems,
it may be best to avoid it.

00:15:08.574 --> 00:15:09.742
This way then.

00:15:14.247 --> 00:15:15.456
Let's go. Hurry it up!

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:16.457
Ri-- Right.

00:15:16.916 --> 00:15:18.668
Leon! Where are you? Leon!

00:15:18.918 --> 00:15:19.919
What is your status?

00:15:20.294 --> 00:15:23.381
<i>The condition of the reactor...</i>
<i>Jay and I...</i>

00:15:23.881 --> 00:15:25.216
What? I can't hear you!

00:15:25.591 --> 00:15:26.759
What about the reactor?

00:15:27.009 --> 00:15:27.885
Hey, Leon!

00:15:28.386 --> 00:15:29.554
Not that it matters,

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:32.890
but isn't the reactor
right under the city hall?

00:15:33.182 --> 00:15:34.267
Let's go.

00:15:44.193 --> 00:15:47.613
We are now at the deepest area,
the reactor system control room.

00:15:48.281 --> 00:15:53.077
<i>Currently there is no visible damage</i>
<i>to the lighting, the suppression device,</i>

00:15:53.453 --> 00:15:55.538
<i>or the reactor itself.</i>

00:15:56.205 --> 00:15:57.457
<i>Leon and I will now</i>

00:15:57.582 --> 00:16:01.627
<i>put on protective gear and attempt</i>
<i>to access the reactor's core.</i>

00:16:02.295 --> 00:16:04.172
Just to be safe, the security cameras--

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:13.264
Status report?

00:16:13.473 --> 00:16:15.475
All systems have lost power?!

00:16:15.641 --> 00:16:17.810
-And the emergency backups?
-They're running,

00:16:17.935 --> 00:16:19.520
but we're not reading their GPS!

00:16:19.604 --> 00:16:21.731
The emergency circuit
has been disconnected!

00:16:32.533 --> 00:16:33.367
Leon!

00:16:33.451 --> 00:16:34.702
The core has gone berserk,

00:16:34.785 --> 00:16:37.663
the evolutionary fields
and multidimensional space are leaking!

00:16:37.914 --> 00:16:40.666
At this rate,
we'll have another Xianglong Crisis!

00:17:02.021 --> 00:17:02.939
I...

00:17:03.481 --> 00:17:05.233
want to protect Neo Xianglong!

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:08.069
In order to do so, I...

00:17:08.569 --> 00:17:11.614
I would do anything!

00:17:14.659 --> 00:17:15.868
Jay!

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:18.621
Anything!

00:17:19.163 --> 00:17:20.164
Anything!

00:17:20.957 --> 00:17:22.291
Anything at all!

00:17:28.172 --> 00:17:29.173
But...

00:17:29.924 --> 00:17:32.051
the one who can resolve this situation...

00:17:32.843 --> 00:17:33.844
is not me!

00:17:42.478 --> 00:17:44.730
-Jay! Are you okay?
-Leon Lau!

00:17:45.356 --> 00:17:47.066
It's up to you!

00:17:48.359 --> 00:17:50.278
You're the only one who can do it!

00:17:53.114 --> 00:17:54.115
Okay.

00:18:00.079 --> 00:18:02.123
If you fail, you will be punished.

00:18:02.832 --> 00:18:03.666
Leon.

00:18:03.791 --> 00:18:04.834
Jay.

00:18:11.674 --> 00:18:15.011
I swear,
we had better get overtime for this.

00:18:16.971 --> 00:18:17.972
A loss of gravity?

00:18:18.639 --> 00:18:21.100
The reactor's multidimensional effect
is this powerful?

00:18:22.435 --> 00:18:24.395
So, it's on the brink of a rampage...

00:18:28.649 --> 00:18:29.650
Is that...

00:18:41.287 --> 00:18:44.165
This is the reactor's core? Chaos.

00:18:51.881 --> 00:18:55.468
With this, the Legendre polynomial
converges to a singular point.

00:18:55.926 --> 00:18:56.927
All right!

00:19:15.613 --> 00:19:16.572
Leon!

00:19:24.372 --> 00:19:27.583
Without you...
Without you this world will...

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:42.098
Leon!

00:20:03.953 --> 00:20:05.454
Jay...

00:20:10.584 --> 00:20:11.752
It won't open.

00:20:11.836 --> 00:20:12.837
Out of the way.

00:20:18.092 --> 00:20:19.093
Leon!

00:20:22.054 --> 00:20:24.056
-Is everyone all right?
-Yes.

00:20:25.224 --> 00:20:26.976
A team, huh?

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:30.312
Thanks to you two, our city is safe.

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:33.691
Leon.

00:20:33.941 --> 00:20:35.985
I'm so hungry.

00:20:37.862 --> 00:20:40.072
<i>Huh? What is this place?</i>

00:20:41.991 --> 00:20:44.410
What are you doing here, Leon Lau?

00:20:50.249 --> 00:20:51.250
Um...

00:20:54.003 --> 00:20:55.087
Come with me!

00:20:55.921 --> 00:20:56.756
Huh?

00:20:57.465 --> 00:20:58.549
Okay.

00:21:22.031 --> 00:21:23.199
It's so good!

00:21:23.574 --> 00:21:26.327
I give it 120 points. No, 200!

00:21:27.161 --> 00:21:29.705
It's the Yoon family specialty, Mapo Tofu.

00:21:34.752 --> 00:21:37.046
What is it? Was it too spicy?

00:21:37.755 --> 00:21:38.756
No.

00:21:39.673 --> 00:21:41.717
It's just so delicious.

00:21:42.593 --> 00:21:44.678
Please teach me
how to make this some time.

00:21:45.596 --> 00:21:46.806
Do you cook?

00:21:47.389 --> 00:21:50.559
According to Chloe,
only dishes worth 45 points.

00:21:53.145 --> 00:21:55.731
Does this mean I finally beat you
at something?

00:21:56.857 --> 00:22:01.153
Is it possible that long ago, you and I...

00:22:04.907 --> 00:22:05.908
Work calls.

00:23:46.634 --> 00:23:50.846
THE TOWER OF GRUDGES

00:23:50.929 --> 00:23:52.014
Subtitle translation by
Amanda Miller
